%% Pipeline OpenTelemetry + Prometheus — exportar PNG como diagramas/pipeline-opentelemetry.png %%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Cliente HTTP
  participant V as Pod vLLmOpenAI inferencia
  participant S3 as Mount S3 models
  participant O as OTel Collector observability
  participant P as Prometheus monitoring
  participant K as KEDA metrics adapter
  participant SM as AWS Secrets Manager
  participant CX as Coralogix OTLP

  C->>V: POST /v1/chat/completions ou completions
  V->>S3: leitura pesos via Mountpoint CSI IRSA vllm
  V-->>O: OTLP traces metrics opcional gRPC 4317
  O->>V: GET /metrics scrape Prometheus receiver
  P->>V: GET /metrics scrape job vllm
  P->>O: GET /metrics scrape self-metrics 8888
  O->>SM: leitura credencial via Secret Store CSI IRSA otel sync env
  O->>CX: OTLP export gRPC headers Authorization Bearer
  K->>P: PromQL sum vllm_num_requests_waiting
  K->>V: HPA scale Deployment vllm-openai
